# verbatim: "표-평문-버튼 이게 기본이라고 왜 표가 제일 아래에나와").
#
# MEASURED SHAPE OF THE DEFECT: at session start the only table surface was the
# dashboard PIN, which the bridge posts/updates on its own clock -- so the
# owner's screen read 평문(컨디션 질문) -> 버튼 -> (later) 카드. No code fixed
# the order because no code EMITTED a table into the chat flow at all.
